        {
          "text": "kugira ngo Abalewi, bo badafise ishamvu yabo bwite barazwe, hamwe n’abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi baba mu bisagara vyanyu baronke ico barya bahage, ni ho ",
